<title>NETHERLANDS: TELEGRAAF 1996 NET DOWN 16.5 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>TELEGRAAF 1996 NET DOWN 16.5 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.61 vs   1.93</p>
<p>    Net profit			    84.6  vs 101.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  0.68 vs   0.675</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  1.28 vs   1.15</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   143.3  vs 135.4</p>
<p>    Financial charges		    5.6  vs  19.3 gain</p>
<p>NOTE - Publisher NV Holdingmaatschappij De Telegraaf</p>
<p>previously said it expected a substantially lower 1996 net</p>
<p>because of start-up costs at its commercial television units.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
